app-aligned.apk
build/
classes.dex
*.tmp
# Signing material must never be committed or shipped: supply it via KS/KS_PASS.
# A signing key is the one file whose leak is not repairable by reissuing: an APK
# signed with a different key cannot update an installed com.macchanger at all,
# so the user must uninstall and lose the app-private NVRAM backup.
ks.p12
*.jks
*.keystore
*.p12
*.pk8
*.pem
*.der
*.key
# The audit (AUDIT.md, audit/PLAN.json) is tracked: README.md, CHANGELOG.md and
# VERIFICATION.md all cite it, and a reader deciding whether to run a root tool
# on their only phone is entitled to the evidence and the known limitations.
# tools/package.sh still excludes it from the RELEASE archive it builds, because
# that archive is for users while this is the record of why the tree changed.

